{"job_id":"F-3eaf42c29664e024311f","family_id":"F-3eaf42c29664e024311f","title":"선박등기법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":5,"target_id":"714c0a10f8b8d61f986a1f9747a63de3d543d5565325d7f946b9a30f713306ba","source_hash":"8eb2e887a1d3f45a915d0efdcf3cb3db38439c8ea1bd7f864b8db3e4524eaf18","text":"船舶登记法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":59,"target_id":"892b02c41e010092d2d635181233d104ee08b7a85f2077a72053d1dc04f272fb","source_hash":"30e1b77efd14a225da1ab0abfb966ec94f49f0851161969c3f2ac7173a4756cb","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是规定船舶法第八条第四款规定的船舶登记事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":59,"end":181,"target_id":"e4351bf2a6d2a394330a77792984c2d2bca3391bca25c20ce039c72e14cdd55e","source_hash":"df0f1b4c845c4ef2a94d57d869ce758ac7e91d5cfddc87bf62253f60a13a5d46","text":"第二条（适用范围）本法适用于总吨位二十吨以上的汽船和帆船，以及总吨位一百吨以上的驳船。但是，本法不适用于《船舶法》第二十六条第四款规定的驳船。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":181,"end":274,"target_id":"ec46fce906960927bd378ce30c712f50bb6fbe8d4ef2e13e8b19c2e384897f5e","source_hash":"d1509055672f434c7c0bd2bbdedd768655cfd0c1be39d40d01113208af83322e","text":"第三条（登记事项）船舶登记是为了设立、保存、转让、变更、限制处置或消灭下列各款所列的权利。\n1. 所有权\n2. 抵押贷款\n3. 租赁\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":274,"end":348,"target_id":"acc4f320e1e6686dbaf7bff2280f2fe6dfda34325b72f83d3ed9fe4e10cbb370","source_hash":"1ae0c522d45d2ca944e56e36ef5218b7fb38684f6af05c63dd87c3ee58b564ed","text":"第四条（主管登记机关）船舶登记的主管登记机关是地方法院、地方法院分院或者对拟登记船舶登记港有管辖权的登记机关。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":348,"end":726,"target_id":"e2e7a4ec82613af9bdb6ae911e111b57be5e2ddbac2b325cdeba02dd54dea1ca","source_hash":"d2d9cc771fdd1f9afbf6fbb6567383d66f2171b9a613b0d0ad3e75606c0551cd","text":"第五条（适用条款）第四条至第六条、第八条至第十三条、第十四条（第二款至第四款）、第十六条至第二十条、第二十二条、第二十三条、第二十四条（第一款第一项和第二款）、第二十五条至第三十三条、第四十八条、第五十条至第五十九条、第六十三条、第六十四条、第六十六条（第一款）、第六十七条、第七十四条至第九十八条、第一百条、第一百零一条（不包括关于使用计算机信息处理系统提出异议的部分）、第一百零二条至第一百零九条、第一百零九条之二（第一款和第三款）（仅限与第一款相关的部分）、第一百一十条和第一百一十一条的规定，比照适用于船舶登记。 <修订于 1991.12.14、2011.4.12、2011.6.15、2020.2.4、2024.9.20>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":726,"end":767,"target_id":"3abd164ca0c6a0516a39042ab42a8f54eb258291e365c9487e34328691eb38cc","source_hash":"d22353b71f089f261f3b709472b0d3fb3b6d47f9340a0a4ee1417c20e7697c37","text":"第六条（授权规定） 为执行本法所必需的事项，由最高法院规则规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":767,"end":919,"target_id":"884e3ef574e7d95bd262c56e0f5443b03bfda29e1fbed87454799128b17a2901","source_hash":"167e0876e94cf80c54838d9b7790826ecd881fb9d001badad612d5a3feff2911","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 1331，1963 年 4 月 18 日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）在本法实施之前按照以前规定进行的船舶登记，应视为按照本法进行的登记。\n\n③（硬币）本法实施前编制的登记册应视为本法项下的登记册。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":919,"end":948,"target_id":"87f6c8497571715ef58729db813d2b171f6ccb526d68bbdf0c91e5448dea18a0","source_hash":"8938f3fb7cca82a9dd1ff32be15be857d1be3c5990d3bcf15e7daa12bbfd1ca6","text":"附录（船舶法）<第3641号法案，1982年12月31日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":948,"end":979,"target_id":"a1c80aadb0211a579db865053eaffa99155d6a68980d6834a874a85fe4860bc0","source_hash":"b0ae4928530bf25cb4d73b205cbbe4e5bc7019cc91fd22d9882f5c28e84c5cfb","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":979,"end":994,"target_id":"76788b208a700538f13b4f4edcc3be4756a664597cc2364bb4e8318948133a86","source_hash":"5b9afbdf2e8854c1395bfd4c406e8831273cb316d6a621d74a00d09486bb51ae","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":994,"end":1120,"target_id":"a66a1baedb53d905400c81cd8f3f5919d8399e18c25897bc84127858f292e5e8","source_hash":"d18e3557fa2371831bae2ba449af3f4ff566803ea452da1a1a37d7eb4572c78f","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 修改船舶登记法如下。\n\n  第 1 条中的“船舶法第 36 条”应改为“船舶法第 8 条第 4 款”。\n\n  第 2 条中的“总吨位小于 20 吨”应改为“总吨位小于 20 吨”。\n\n  ② 和 ③ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1120,"end":1152,"target_id":"ff575fe33d226081f657eddbc20d801bd5aa32f4534bd68c319338fdc5363a97","source_hash":"801052053e2aabac4a8a7ac3ba2614bd7a7ef06bc9d30665a1029dc76c1e75ab","text":"补充规定（不动产登记法）<第4422号法令，1991年12月14日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1152,"end":1188,"target_id":"d52a5acd551784caaf145a94a31953b3e19c5192f7f3204b3ba162f598ad4ee9","source_hash":"c1ea9e20372057c5cdc8e37dd9e127a412cfdab0b997e6003784f0b96a6b37e6","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自1992年2月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1188,"end":1203,"target_id":"a31b7b7342e15afd0f9a5772af88a7afb8691122dc3563b3738817d0b2a54fef","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1203,"end":1330,"target_id":"f02b371f0867394365f3efde6cb13f33450e404d6d5f5422cb265ed21d2ca4c0","source_hash":"0ef6d312bac0898668bdd8b0bcbc1ec1893116f9b843e765301439fcb9923246","text":"第五条（其他法律的修改等）①至③ 省略\n\n  ④ 《船舶登记法》修改如下。\n\n  从第 5 条中删除“第 135 条”，并将“第 156 条”改为“第 156-2 条”，将“第 158 条”改为“第 166 条”。\n\n  ⑤ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1330,"end":1358,"target_id":"478fda19e71efcc75a8f99c0fda649d539161e6d94f9a925a8446026b12d91e9","source_hash":"77869dd80f551e0e2ff5bb34ca74318222be49d666f8c0b0434952f6e6b1b463","text":"增补（船舶法）<第5972号，1999年4月15日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1358,"end":1595,"target_id":"2ee7d85a505e13d66fd4c2d7fe27132b6e1e1424d79302df791a7205e39be064","source_hash":"ce8ba96f48649844bac942ef9235113af7d88742e93c1209d44bfaf0cd182ee0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。但是，第一条第二款的修正规定（仅限于根据该条修正规定申请新登记的船舶的登记申请和根据该条规定签发国籍证书的情况）、第二条第三款的修正规定、第二十六条第二款的修正规定（仅限于根据该条修正规定申请签发装运证书的船舶的装运证书申请和根据该条规定签发装运证书的情况）以及附录第四条的修正规定，自附录公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1595,"end":1609,"target_id":"d786533cc314914d829c40d1a79861404f311f123a8c0ef5b2a61aa07c01181e","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1609,"end":1666,"target_id":"505211e0110f9b63dca4de5f620d5240f82c7051453c180d4ed6bff7b85930b9","source_hash":"4409e3985671d9a66a049e637b68e7535bec478465ed69d71c39ed7218c0f317","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）① 修改船舶登记法如下。\n\n  第二条内容如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1666,"end":1801,"target_id":"e95e56b2af91d6a565fd5c2960ee30fe2424fc2e0ad1075bb6a47d452f142b8d","source_hash":"093635324bc70f201715b87cad327a9699a7ed551e17ceec0491adf1a76f5e74","text":"  第二条（适用范围）本法适用于总吨位20吨以上的轮船、帆船，以及总吨位100吨以上的驳船。但是，本法不适用于固定安装在水面上用于系泊、储存等用途的驳船。\n\n  ②省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1801,"end":1902,"target_id":"b4ed039fc42379c4d344bd317fa64dde8c8f1a0930b4da33cc8817076ba6801e","source_hash":"4562d1b176380849518fd709542ffe1672542f6427c837cfab2f9c62b6b303df","text":"增补（船舶法）<第9870号，2009年12月29日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n②（其他法律的修订）船舶登记法部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001180-265383-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1902,"end":1971,"target_id":"0a364c16d8c88895f8c039febd83d6f34067fe25207c2f7b963a17cdcd1b136a","source_hash":"470faa4592afd33c1d78fc3ff6c43051d33149d3c7b7df0c0db09d7a789bc1e7","text":"第二条但书如下。 \n\n  但是，根据《船舶法》第 26 条第 4 款正文的规定，这不适用于驳船